WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
[Music]

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.700
Every mission runs on awareness.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.600
Haliax turns soldier-worn glasses
into an intelligence layer.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.100
It hears what the squad misses and translates
the local language, right in your ear.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.700
It reads the terrain and flags threats
before they close in.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.900
Audio and video. Soldier controlled.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.700
Open by design. Ready for any platform.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.000
Haliax. See first.
